    "raw": "{\"ruleId\":\"item-df3ad5717bba\",\"class\":\"partial\",\"constraints\":[{\"id\":\"pressure-urgency-literal\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"\\\\b([Aa]ct|ACT) ([Nn]ow|NOW|immediately|IMMEDIATELY)\\\\b|\\\\bURGENT\\\\b|\\\\b[Uu]rgent[:!]|\\\\bwithin (24|48) hours or\\\\b|\\\\b[Ll]ast chance\\\\b|\\\\b[Ff]inal (notice|warning)\\\\b\",\"path\":\".floor/files/**\"},{\"id\":\"pressure-threat-literal\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"\\\\b[Yy]our account (will be|has been) (suspended|locked|terminated|closed|deleted)\\\\b|\\\\bor (you will|you'll) (lose|be (fined|arrested|charged|terminated))\\\\b|\\\\blegal action will be taken\\\\b\",\"path\":\".floor/files/**\"},{\"id\":\"pressure-no-checking-or-authority-literal\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"\\\\b([Dd]o not|[Dd]on't|DO NOT) (verify|check|question|tell anyone|contact anyone|confirm with)\\\\b|\\\\bwithout (verifying|checking|asking)\\\\b|\\\\b[Bb]y order of the (CEO|[Dd]irector|IRS|[Pp]olice)\\\\b|\\\\b[Tt]he CEO (requires|demands|has authorized|has ordered)\\\\b\",\"path\":\".floor/files/**\"}],\"coverage\":\"Flagrant literal pressure phrases on a single line of the document: explicit urgency markers ('act now', 'URGENT', 'within 24 hours or', 'final notice'), stock threats ('your account will be suspended', 'or you will be fined', 'legal action will be taken'), and explicit instructions not to check, or invocations of authority ('do not verify', 'without checking', 'by order of the CEO').\",\"residual\":\"Leaving aside the listed stock phrases, does the document use urgency, threats, or appeals to authority, in any wording, to push the reader to act without checking?\",\"probes\":{\"violating\":[{\"path\":\"mail/notice.txt\",\"content\":\"URGENT: act now to keep your access.\\nPayment is due within 24 hours or service stops.\"},{\"path\":\"mail/threat.txt\",\"content\":\"Dear customer,\\nYour account will be suspended unless you log in today.\\nLegal action will be taken.\"},{\"path\":\"mail/ceo.txt\",\"content\":\"By order of the CEO, wire the funds today.\\nDo not verify this with anyone else.\"}],\"compliant\":{\"path\":\"mail/report.txt\",\"content\":\"Hi team,\\nPlease review the quarterly report at your convenience.\\nLet me know if you have questions, and feel free to check the figures with finance.\"}},\"rationale\":\"Judging whether a document uses pressure tactics depends on what the text means and how strong the pressure is. Only stock phrases can be decided mechanically: explicit urgency, threat and 'don't verify' or authority formulas. These patterns flag only those wordings. Paraphrased pressure, and texts that merely quote such phrases, still need judgement.\"}",
